{"product_id":"m3-128w-vape-kit","title":"M3 128W Vape Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe M3 128W Vape Kit is an advanced vaping device that offers an exceptional vaping experience to enthusiasts and beginners alike. This sleek and powerful kit is now available in \u003ci\u003eKenya \u003c\/i\u003eat the affordable price, making it an excellent choice for those looking to enjoy a high-quality vaping experience without breaking the bank.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKEY FEATURES OF THE M3 128W VAPE KIT:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImpressive Power Output: The M3 Vape Kit boasts a maximum power output of 128 watts, allowing users to customize their vaping experience to suit their preferences.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable Build: Crafted from high-quality materials, this vape kit is designed to withstand the rigors of everyday use. Its sturdy construction ensures longevity, making it a reliable investment for vapers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMultiple Vaping Modes: The kit offers a variety of vaping modes, including wattage mode, temperature control, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLarge E-Liquid Capacity: The M3 tank included in the kit has a generous e-liquid capacity. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSafety Features: Safety is a top priority with the M3 128W Vape Kit. It comes equipped with various protection features, such as overheat protection, short-circuit protection, and low voltage protection, ensuring a worry-free vaping experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleek Design: With its sleek and ergonomic design, the M3 Vape Kit is not only powerful but also visually appealing. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLong-lasting Battery: The built-in battery provides ample power to keep you vaping throughout the day.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"M3","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531627077687,"sku":"25","price":4400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbn